text.section:
Notwithstanding any other provision of this section, no credit shall be allowed pursuant to subsection B in any taxable year in which the individual, the individual's spouse, or both, or any person claimed as a dependent on such individual's or married individuals' income tax return, claims one or any combination of the following on his or their income tax return for such taxable year:

The subtraction under subdivision 8 of § 58.1-322.02;


The subtraction under subdivision 15 of § 58.1-322.02;


The subtraction under subdivision 16 of § 58.1-322.02;


The deduction for the additional personal exemption for blind or aged taxpayers under subdivision 2 b of § 58.1-322.03; or


The deduction under subdivision 5 of § 58.1-322.03.
